1's input selection agree. -> @planner\n\nVERDICT: CHANGES-REQUESTED findings=1\n'@\n[System.IO.Directory]::CreateDirectory([System.IO.Path]::GetDirectoryName(\"'$verdictPath)) | Out-Null\n[System.IO.File]::WriteAllText($verdictPath, $verdictText + \"`n\", [System.Text.UTF8Encoding]::new($false))\nGet-Content -LiteralPath $verdictPath | Select-Object -First 1\nGet-Content -LiteralPath $verdictPath | Select-Object -Last 1'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
